      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each round's path goes through the middle edge of capacity 1, so |f| grows by only 1 per round.\nEven rounds cancel that unit with the backward edge b\u2192a; odd rounds push it through a\u2192b again.\nMax flow |f*| = 2000, so this choice needs 2000 rounds of O(E) each: O(E \u00b7 |f*|) in total.\nBFS (Edmonds-Karp) picks the 2-edge paths s\u2192a\u2192t and s\u2192b\u2192t and finishes in just 2 rounds.",
      "originalText": "Each round's path goes through the middle edge of capacity 1, so |f| grows by only 1 per round.\nEven rounds cancel that unit with the backward edge b\u2192a; odd rounds push it through a\u2192b again.\nMax flow |f*| = 2000, so this choice needs 2000 rounds of O(E) each: O(E \u00b7 |f*|) in total.\nBFS (Edmonds-Karp) picks the 2-edge paths s\u2192a\u2192t and s\u2192b\u2192t and finishes in just 2 rounds.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch12-14-ff-worst-case-n8",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    }
